stateDiagram-v2
 state Capture {
 state Source {
  [*] --> Unchanged
  Unchanged --> Unchanged: Equivalent commit
  Unchanged --> Unchanged: Rollback
  Unchanged --> Written: Meaningful commit
  Written --> Written: Replay
  Written --> Written: Rollback
 }
 --
 state Receipt {
  [*] --> Quiet
  Quiet --> Quiet: Equivalent commit
  Quiet --> Quiet: Rollback
  Quiet --> Pending: Meaningful commit
  Pending --> Pending: Replay
  Pending --> Pending: Rollback
 }
 }
 %% never AtomicCapture: Pending & Unchanged -- No receipt without a committed material change.
 %% never NoLostCapture: Quiet & Written -- A committed meaningful change has a pending receipt.
